olving gradients, mask, and filters.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>???? <a href=\"https://twitter.com/RitikaAgrawal08/status/1733480854272254022\">Button Wave Animation</a></h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>A thread through Ritika Agrawal on easy methods to pull off a groovy button wave animation in 5 steps.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>???? <a href=\"https://razrfalcon.github.io/notes-on-svg-parsing/\">Notes on SVG Parsing</a></h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>This e book in development through Yevhenii Reizner supplies very fascinating insights into the demanding situations of parsing and rendering SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics), highlighting the complexity of this XML-based vector document layout regardless of its user-friendly look.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>???? <a href=\"https://kizu.dev/shrinkwrap-problem/\">The Shrinkwrap Downside: Conceivable Long term Answers</a></h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>This text through Roman Komarov addresses the longstanding CSS factor of mechanically wrapping content material and the related downside of calculating container width, proposing an answer the use of anchor positioning for inline parts.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>Bramus displays easy methods to create an unique accordion the use of more than one `&lt;main points&gt;` parts with the similar identify characteristic, permitting just one segment to be open at a time, and offers a JavaScript polyfill for browsers that don’t improve the vital occasions.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>???? <a href=\"https://blakewatson.com/journal/omg-lol-an-oasis-on-the-internet/\">omg.lol: An Oasis at the Web</a></h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>Blake Watson discusses his transition from the use of Twitter to becoming a member of Mastodon and highlights the options and neighborhood of the omg.lol platform.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>????‍???? <a href=\"https://svg-tutorial.com/\">SVG Instructional Introduct